{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg72mZqfKpfhvG8u3B4u5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, you can self-host Firecrawl. This is from memory, so check the repo's `LICENSE` file before you rely on it.\n\n**License**\n- The main repo (`mendableai/firecrawl`, now `firecrawl/firecrawl`) is **AGPL-3.0**.\n- Some parts are under different licenses. The SDKs and some UI components were MIT, and the repo's README or per-directory `LICENSE` files say which.\n\n**What AGPL means for a company**\n- **Internal use:** If you run it unmodified, or modified, for your own teams and pipelines, you generally have no obligation to publish anything.\n- **Network-use clause:** If you modify Firecrawl and let outside users interact with it over a network, for example as a hosted scraping service, you must offer those users the corresponding source of your modified version.\n- **Embedding or distributing:** If you ship it inside a product you distribute, or build a SaaS on top of a modified fork, the copyleft terms apply to the derivative work.\n- **Calling it as a separate service:** Your own apps that call its API over HTTP are generally not considered derivative works. Your legal team should confirm this.\n- **Corporate policy:** Many companies ban AGPL software outright, so check with legal or compliance first.\n\n**Practical caveats**\n- The self-hosted version has historically lacked some features of the cloud product. The main one is Fire-engine, which handles anti-bot and proxy work, so results on hard sites are usually worse.\n- You run the infrastructure yourself: Redis, workers, Playwright, and any proxies you want.\n- If AGPL is a blocker, Firecrawl has offered commercial or enterprise licensing, or you can use the hosted API instead.\n\nI can fetch the current `LICENSE` and self-hosting docs to confirm the details if you'd like."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6762,"cache_read_input_tokens":11227,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6762},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9fc8fc45-d4cd-4522-975d-157b5caa9803","uuid":"fd3d8d4c-c2b1-49ed-85ef-d061a48523cb","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:36:45.598Z","request_id":"req_011Cg72mZa34CdVDJG6zaKSo"}
